  "validation_notes": [
    "Initial cold-record pointer assertion captured its baseline before native fullscreen animation; settled-Space baseline and before/after evidence passed without product changes.",
    "First moving-pointer assertion did not wait for synthetic mouse motion to settle. With settled input and explicit before/after evidence, pointer, active app and zero leaked clicks passed.",
    "Broad live run ended with an overly specific closed-window status assertion expecting not found. The fixture retains its NSWindow after close, so macOS retains CG metadata and Tandem stops with cannot be reached. Independent close follow-up verified closed visibility, empty action order and zero sibling/other-app clicks.",
    "An additional closed-target cursor/focus check was interrupted by unrelated native input: pointer moved and Ace became frontmost. Not counted as a pass; playback pointer/focus isolation passed separately during actual repeated playback."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Live cross-Space coverage is native AppKit AXPress-backed left single clicks, three recorded actions across two windows and four loops.",
    "Other-Space support requires queryable/cached exact Accessibility targets; current-macro loading, recording and Space visits prepare those handles without input or activation. Cold launch already away from targets can require visiting their Space once.",
    "Background keyboard/text/swipe macros still require Foreground; unsupported off-Space actions report a stop rather than being treated as supported.",
    "No new universal Brave, Roblox or other game compatibility claim."
